{number: 169}
{title: Were You There?}
{key: Eb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Eb] Were you there when they crucified my Lord?
Were you [Ab] there when they crucified my [Eb] Lord?
Oh, [Cm] sometimes it [Ab] causes me to [Eb] tremble, [Bb7] tremble, [Cm] tremble;
[Eb] Were you there when they [Ab] crucified my [Eb] Lord?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
